      "writtenOn": "2021-06-07T15:25:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Out of curiosity, why is the iv protected if the key is public? What is gained by hiding it from other classes?\n\nAlso, can it be final? I don\u0027t see you assigning it anywhere else but the constructor.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 471,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 471,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "8e19d42ff32fd681b8f9c4cc540c10fc663c503c",
