    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7c100d1b_0e23df0b",
        "filename": "tests/cts/net/src/android/net/cts/PacketUtils.java",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 471,
      "author": {
        "id": 1297255
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-08T00:15:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is protected because it is not final and thus I want to give it more restrictions. It cannot be private because subclass need to access it. (e.g. EspCryptCipher#getCipherText)\n\nIt cannot be final because we need to update the IV in the followup CL. See https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Connectivity/+/1503694/12/tests/cts/net/src/android/net/cts/PacketUtils.java#499).\n\nI think to make code review easier I should have made \"iv\" public final in this CL and changed it later when we need to update it. Sorry for the inconvenience.",
      "parentUuid": "68c02407_da7c36f9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 471,
